# Doxygen warning baseline for the ratchet check.
# doxygen 1.14.0
# Entries are line-number-agnostic (file: warning text) so
# unrelated edits do not shift warnings into 'new' status.
# Shrink by fixing warnings, regenerate with
#   python3 dev/check_doxygen_warnings.py --update-baseline
# Never grow this file to silence a new warning.
